  - Smooth curves for better flow
  - Hover and highlight colors (orange/amber)

  Visual Polish:
  - Shadows on both nodes and edges for depth
  - Better physics spacing (300px spring length vs 220px)
  - Navigation buttons enabled for zoom/pan controls
  - Keyboard navigation support

  Better Layout:
  - More space between nodes (avoid overlap: 1.2)
  - Stronger gravitational forces for better clustering
